# Deploy to Localhost After Each Iteration

After making changes to this project:

1. Run `npm run build` to compile
2. Run `npx next start -p 3002` (or kill existing and restart) so the production server serves the latest build
3. The site is viewable at **http://localhost:3002**

Do this after every iteration of edits so the user can review changes immediately.
